# Routine "Weekly queue review": the template does not carry a machine-readable schedule
# (Grok Bot sets it when the routine is created/enabled).
# Cadence described in the template: Every Monday morning, the whole event request queue grouped by what needs a decision, what is stale, and what is already committed.
# Fill in the five cron fields, then add to crontab -e:
# M H DOM MON DOW cd /path/to/event-request-desk && pi -p "/weekly-event-queue-review"
